    "title": "U.C. Davis to bring five football games to broadcast TV in Sacramento - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Matthew Keys ,\n1 days ago U.C. Davis Intercollegiate Athletics has struck a deal with Paramount‘s CBS News & Stations to bring at least five games to local broadcast television during its upcoming season. The five games will air on KMAX-TV (Channel 31), an independent station that already offers locally-televised sports from the Sacramento Rivercats... Read full article",
